// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P957125469" "Infernal! He is free!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1536613899" "Flee!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1145027533" "The spell is failing!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4263672758" "Run!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3845303883" "Toph Osir has fallen! Infernal has broken free!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3203709314" "Forget {HeroName}. Retreat!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2734402751" "Infernal"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P960298667" "<shout>Magical bindings..."
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P649839973" "<shout>Your spirit is shrouded in darkness. Release Numina and take the first step toward redemption."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2744932201" "<shout>If it is battle you seek, then it is battle you shall have!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2105583614" "<shout>You consort with daemon worshippers and they betrayed you. Can you not see that this path is the wrong one?"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1365766000" "<shout>You will release Numina, or I WILL kill you."
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P2741841118" "No! Numina! I have... failed... you..."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P628829050" "<em victory>Now, villain, let us discuss the release of my friend."
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2275253406" "Hello there son"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1279342365" "<shout>With that sorcerer dispatched I am free!<em>And with my newfound freedom I will seize that dreadful artifact and release Numina!<em>{HeroName}, prepare yourself for battle!"

