// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3947307289" "<shout>Must...<em>...serve...<em>...Numina..."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1456234656" "<shout>{HeroName}!"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P1127431811" "Hello, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2087686396" "Freedom!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3086124165" "The witches spell is broken!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P99838461" "{HeroName} freed us... thank you."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3596232643" "She is gone!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2656194376" "<shout>Must...<em>...help...<em>...Infernal..."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4068265973" "<shout>Where is Infernal?!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P860672441" "I am released!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P685134882" "Free at long last."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1412977747" "Finally free of that spell!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P333124443" "Embarrassing, enslaved to her will like that."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2341343740" "<shout>Cannot...<em>...resist...<em>...spell..."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P812016251" "<shout>Free us!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P665189617" "Freedom at last."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3562779547" "Her power is broken."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2841387298" "The spell is shattered!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3404496790" "Cunning witch..."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2878566148" "<shout>Must...<em>...fight...<em>...the spell..."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3311400850" "<shout>Help me!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3711865331" "What happened?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4016236833" "{HeroName} is on our side?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P362821652" "Dreadful spell."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3968120304" "She will pay for that!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1575607881" "Numina"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P741491694" "<shout>Someone in this mouldering city knows what just happened to Infernal, and I want answers NOW!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3556458732" "<shout>{HeroName}!?<em>In league with the Circle of Thorns?<em>You must be behind this!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1219932099" "Haven't you realized yet. With my body incorporeal you cannot truly harm me."
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2718926488" "Why don't you just give up and tell me where Infernal is?"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P2027766923" "<em victory>This may not be the Zig, but I'm sure the denizens are just as friendly. You'll fit right in."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2389629481" "We... we're free!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2311406226" "I'm free, at last!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2139673162" "You've freed me, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1634352369" "At last, the witch is done for!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ScriptCaptureNumina 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P2493757348" "Capture Numina with the Soul Catcher"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1421735819" "The Soul Catcher is an incredibly powerful and dangerous artifact. Be careful with it. When Numina is suitably weakened she will be incapable of resisting its power and her soul will be trapped inside."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4134822231" "You've stolen Numina's soul and escaped from the subterranean realm of the Circle of Thorns.<br><br>It will be a long time before Infernal dares to challenge you again."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2876129236" "Well done... but...<br><br>There are some troubling developments, {hero.gender=male master|mistress}.<br><br><color orange>Mortimer pauses for emphasis of the gravity of the situation</color><br><br> Know that I tell you this because I wish only for my Fiona's safe return...<br><br><color red>The Midnighters</color> have discovered that you are the one behind my daughter's kidnapping. For the time being I have convinced them that I have had no dealings with you, but that charade will not last for long, not when they realize what you are truly after. With that, I implore you to move quickly, for I have no doubt that should you be defeated, then Fiona's death is assured."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - OdysseusDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page FirstVisit Text :
"P2071720403" "Well, well, well... {HeroName}. To what do I owe the honor of you gracing me and my Warriors with your presence?"
// Answer Text :
"P2358377462" "I want your help... With the Midnighters."
// Page FirstVisitPage1 Text :
"P242341229" "The Midnighters and I are currently at peace. What reason can you offer that I should sully that relationship?"
// Answer Text :
"P780597688" "I stole one of their artifacts. If you're interested in buying I could steal more."
// Page FirstVisitPage2 Text :
"P3788132197" "<color orange>Odysseus raises a single eyebrow with practiced perfection.</color><br><br>"Intriguing. A business offer from {HeroName}; a notoriously violent villain from the Rogue Isles, to me - David Odysseus Hill; an incredibly powerful businessman here in Paragon City.<br><br>I'm not buying this story of stolen merchandise. Why not tell me the truth?""
// Answer Text :
"P2422585225" "Fine. I have Mortimer Kal's daughter. The Midnighters want her back."
// Page FirstVisitPage3 Text :
"P2140703121" "Now THAT I believe.<br><br>Very bold of you to go so far as kidnap the daughter of one of the most powerful and reclusive wizards of our time. I assume he has not transformed you into a burning cinder because of the threat of his daughter's life being tied to your own?"
// Answer Text :
"P2063215738" "Something like that. I was hoping we could send them a message together."
// Page FirstVisitPage4 Text :
"P3503702985" "Perhaps I should turn you over to them and cultivate their favor instead...<br><br>I give you this one chance to prove that that would be an unwise choice.<br><br>I present to you this challenge: Even odds. My Warriors versus you and yours."
// Answer Text :
"P542885946" "What?"
// Page FirstVisitPage5 Text :
"P1910398067" "At this juncture you have no say in the matter.<br><br>Warriors.<br><br>Kill them."
// Answer Text :
"P2054413483" "Bring it! (Fight)"
// Page FightingWarriors Text :
"P3895969044" "There is a time for words and a time for swords, {HeroName}. If I were you, I would turn my attention to fighting my men who are trying to kill you."
// Answer Text :
"P392281881" "You son of a... (Fight)"
// Page DefeatedWarriors Text :
"P1819496971" "You are indeed as powerful as your legend claims. The eyes of the gods smile upon you this day, for I see in you a kindred warrior spirit..."
// Answer Text :
"P2523018756" "I'll kill you for that!"
// Page DefeatedWarriorsPage2 Text :
"P2556953279" "<color orange>Odysseus gives you a look.</color><br><br>"Come now, {HeroName}. I had to make sure that if I joined with you that you could pull your own weight. And what better way to know one's strength than through battle?<br><br>You needn't worry, I will lend you the support of my Warriors, especially if what you said about stealing artifacts is actually true.<br><br>Now, tell me, what was your plan?""
// Answer Text :
"P3101632583" "With all of them out searching for me..."
// Page DefeatedWarriorsPage3 Text :
"P3031885877" "<color orange>Odysseus gives you the smile of a shark.</color><br><br>"They'll have left home and hearth woefully unguarded...<br><br>I like it. My Warriors will swoop in and take every last valuable they own. At long last Sheldon's treasures will be mine!""
// Answer Text :
"P3157983141" "As you can see, this results in gain for us both."
// Page DefeatedWarriorsPage4 Text :
"P945478703" "Well, as always my Warriors thirst for battle, and it just so happens that strategically we are well poised to strike at the Midnighters.<br><br>My men will be overjoyed to learn of our new campaign."
// Answer Text :
"P258140067" "You will not regret this partnership, Odysseus."
// Page SecuredOdysseusHelp Text :
"P3574803510" ""If there is nothing more we need to discuss I am off to have my bath and massage before the coming battle."<br><br><color orange>Odysseus looks to either side of him at Aphrodite and Persephone. They all exchange meaningful looks for an uncomfortable second before Odysseus gives you a 'you can go now' look.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P774411598" "Bath and massage? Actually, forget I asked."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1631563879" "With Numina trapped in the Soul Catcher she has no choice but to obey your commands. Her secrets are now ours... or rather yours, {hero.gender=male master|mistress}.<br><br>Now that you have access to Positron's Laboratory you will need a means to actually handle and manipulate the Flames of Prometheus once you have it within arms reach. Legend has it that only the gods and titans could actually handle the flames. I have planned for this as well..."
// AcceptString :
"P1480566491" "What's the plan?"
// SendOffString :
"P791804536" "<color red>David Odysseus Hill</color> is a 'collector' of rare artifacts from around the world... many of which are magical in nature. In his possession is an artifact that fits our... your exact needs; <color orange>The Fists of Vulcan</color>.<br><br>Odysseus keeps these magical gauntlets stored within one of his shipping and receiving warehouses. These are places filled with ill-gotten treasures whose power ranging from questionable to godly.<br><br>The problem is that Odysseus and his Warriors are currently unengaged in any real gang wars, and so the majority of his forces are more or less conducting garrison duty over the various pieces of territory he claims to be his. You will need to draw his forces away from the warehouses so that you can slip in and steal the Fists of Vulcan before the Warriors can stop you.<br><br>If you could arrange to have Odysseus attack the Midnighters then you could eliminate two threats with one cunningly hurled stone. To do that, you will have to travel to <color yellow>Talos Island</color> and speak to Odysseus on the matter.<br><br>Remember, even though he is a greedy man, David Hill is no idiot. Not only will you have to be shrewd in your dealings, but it would not surprise me if he tried to kill you for the Soul Catcher. It would be best that you do not mention it or Numina's current fate."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2754744192" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: The Hands Of A God</color>"

