// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P761345598" "<shout>Dude, did you see that? I totally nailed that dude in the head with the shotgun!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P804056370" "<shout>Hey? Who is that!?"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2770897166" "<shout>Guard duty is SO boring...<em>Hey, check it out, the boss is in the paper again."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2047209889" "<shout>What the? {HeroName}! Stop {hero.gender=male him|her}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P473071889" "Montague Castanella"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2034951552" "Midnighters, take {hero.gender=male him|her} alive!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P420771704" "Mercedes, Mortimer's daughter is still missing. Only {HeroName} knows where she is."
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1115195060" "Give us Fiona's location, {HeroName}, and we'll consider not turning you over to Mortimer for your crimes."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P4215221194" "You don't pull any punches, do you?"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P577218561" "You'll soon find that I have not yet even begun to fight!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2396704249" "Perhaps this spell will do the trick!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3943090901" "Such... power..."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P3225488446" "<em victory>Now, tell me where the girl is or I shall not show any restraint."

