// Dialog :
"P1300164902" "This heavy duty shipping crate appears to have been opened recently. Inside you find that it contains a large bisected block of white marble within which are carved two halves of a great cavity. The cavity is empty, but looks as if it may have once contained a pair of gauntlets... maybe even the Fists of Vulcan."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Crates1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P4238949120" "Fragile Storage Box"
// InteractActionString :
"P1143515829" "Opening..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1276108130" "Even though the box has the word 'Fragile' on it, the contents are not Italian. The box is filled with packing chips and buried deep beneath them you find a strange lamp, not the Fists of Vulcan."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Crates2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1828207894" "Storage Crate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1210786348" "This crate contains a wooden framework which snuggly holds a number of ancient looking swords from across the western world, not the Fists of Vulcan."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Crates3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3367011062" "Council Storage Crate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P317193937" "This crate is completely empty, yet, for some reason, was sealed up tight with nails and wax."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Crates4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2018129230" "This heavy duty storage crate was locked up tight. Busting the locks reveals a strange glowing green orb, not unlike a lava lamp. While interesting, it is not the Fists of Vulcan."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Crates5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1693861365" "This storage crate is filled with styrofoam packing peanuts and contains a plastic framework holding an ancient looking Mediterranean clay urn, not the Fists of Vulcan."

