// 4 Actor1 :
"P2731350910" "A most admirable display of martial cunning, {HeroName}. I salute you."
// 6 Actor1 :
"P3838119677" "But did you really think that I would take your story at face value? That I wouldn't check your accusations out with spies of my own?"
// 6 Actor1 :
"P3718049637" "Mr. Wade was most helpful in uncovering the truth of your scheme. While my Warriors and the Midnighters hacked each other to pieces you were going to betray me!"
// 6 Actor1 :
"P3008800901" "I don't take lightly to betrayal, {HeroName}. But I do have a sense of honor... or was it sport? If you can defeat me and my Warriors, then the insult against me is dropped. Fail... and I'll introduce you to a little piece of history known as a Brazen Bull."
