// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P2719417765" "Bring me {HeroName}'s head!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1690237826" "Reinforcements, to me!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P277088597" "I have more men than you have breaths left to draw, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3709448181" "Quantity is a quality all its own! To me my brothers!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P2294664214" "Im... poss...i... ble..."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P2180873261" "<em victory>This is a good death, you should be proud."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ScriptDefeatOdysseus 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3861596654" "Defeat Odysseus and take the Fists of Vulcan!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1446410804" "<shout>To Odysseus!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1168060267" "<shout>Nobody escapes!<em>Nobody!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1437676883" "<shout>Don't let {HeroName} get away!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2440080424" "You stole the Fists of Vulcan off of Odysseus's battered body and left him alive. The Warriors will no doubt take care of their fallen leader rather than pursue you, buying you valuable time to escape!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2651699031" "The Fists of Vulcan!<br><br><color orange>Mortimer Kal's eyes shine in amazement as he looks upon the mighty gauntlets that are fabled to have belonged to the god of the forge.</color><br><br>You have all the pieces now, {hero.gender=male master|mistress} and time is running short. Darrin Wade of the Midnighters has learned of our dealings and is threatening to sell me out if I do not cut him in on our scheme. I say to hell with the man. Once you have the Flames of Prometheus it will be he who shall bow before me... I mean, you."
// RandomFameString :
"P2474732514" "I heard there is a bounty on {HeroName}'s head. I don't know who'd be crazy enough to try and collect it though."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - SecurityTerminalAlphaDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page LockedOut Text :
"P3060419388" "<color orange>You have been locked out of the system by B.O.T.L.E.R.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3249019301" "(Leave)"
// Page BothTerminalsDeactivated Text :
"P2380772972" "<color orange>The power displays appear black. There is no power to the force fields any longer.</color>"
// Page TerminalDeactivated Text :
"P2326311848" "<color orange>The power displays continue to flash along with the warning window.</color><br><br>"Confirm force field deactivation at Security Terminal Beta to proceed.""
// Answer Text :
"P3335152055" "Find Security Terminal Beta (Leave)"
// Page TerminalActive Text :
"P2839542335" "<color orange>The security terminal displays a number of power meters for the various force fields located throughout the lab.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1549495246" "Activate Emergency Override"
// Page ActivePage2 Text :
"P3071182428" "<color orange>The power displays flash, but do not power down. A window pops up into the middle of the screen.</color><br><br>"Confirm force field deactivation at Security Terminal Beta to proceed.""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - SecurityTerminalBetaDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page TerminalDeactivated Text :
"P3548963790" "<color orange>The power displays continue to flash along with the warning window.</color><br><br>"Confirm force field deactivation at Security Terminal Alpha to proceed.""
// Answer Text :
"P2523427207" "Find Security Terminal Alpha (Leave)"
// Page ActivePage2 Text :
"P1768256510" "<color orange>The power displays flash, but do not power down. A window pops up into the middle of the screen.</color><br><br>"Confirm force field deactivation at Security Terminal Alpha to proceed.""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - FlamesOfPrometheusDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page BOTLERSAlive Text :
"P2751603116" "<color orange>The containment controls appear to be actively being locked out by... B.O.T.L.E.R.!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P55897591" "Destroy B.O.T.L.E.R."
// Page FlamesMissing Text :
"P2978783413" "<color orange>The containment device burns as brightly as ever with the Flames of Prometheus, but their power is already yours!</color>"
// Page GetTheFlames Text :
"P2731734136" "<color orange>You tap a few keys on the containment computer console. With a single key press you will open the containment device and the Flames of Prometheus will be yours!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P644579748" "Hit the Final Key"
// Page GetTheFlames2 Text :
"P1757948965" "<color orange>The containment device opens and inside you see the blue glow of true incarnate power.<br><br>You put on the Fists of Vulcan and reach into the containment device. Instantly the orange flames of the magical gauntlets are consumed by the raw power of the Flames of Prometheus. In an instant the blue flames crawl up your arms like a gasoline fire, turning the Fists of Vulcan to ash!<br><br>The blue flames settler over your heart and then enter your body. You can feel the power burning deep inside you. You feel invincible!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3239185101" "Revel in the power!"
// Page GetTheFlames3 Text :
"P103748783" "<color orange>You sense a familiar presence. Positron!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P401178726" "Face Positron"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MortimerKalDialogTree2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2000754673" "<color orange>Mortimer Kal's eyes widen as you approach.</color orange><br><br>"The Flames! I can feel their power radiating from you! You have done it!<br><br>Now, as we agreed, return my daughter to me.""
// Answer Text :
"P2095617943" "I don't think so."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P3562066952" "<color orange>Dark power seethes and rages behind Mortimer's eyes. For a moment you think that he might attack you, but then you see the storm clouds of power falter and waver and then slowly dissipate.</color><br><br>"What further use could you have for her? You got what you wanted!""
// Answer Text :
"P169331420" "Numina has escaped, I could use a good wizard at my side."
// Page Page3 Text :
"P680369168" "<color orange>Mortimer appears to accept his fate</color><br><br>"The Midnighters will learn soon enough of my involvement with you. I will truly have nothing more than you to serve and my daughter's safety to attend to.<br><br>What would you ask of me, my {hero.gender=male master|mistress}?""
// Answer Text :
"P2369375152" "What you have already given me, Mortimer. Your loyalty."
// Page Page4 Text :
"P4010932351" "And my loyalty you still have."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P770958246" "My own pursuit of power aside, you now have everything you need, but time, more than ever, is of the essence.<br><br><color red>The Freedom Phalanx</color> is looking for Numina, the Midnight Squad is searching for my daugher and thanks to Darrin Wade now knows that you have something to do with it. If Odysseus talks to the Midnighters then the pieces will fall into place and they will realize that I am helping you to seize the Flames of Prometheus. If that happens before you have claimed its power, then you will be beset upon by enemies on all sides, and my daughter's fate will be bound to your own. You must hurry to Positron's Laboratory in Steel Canyon."
// AcceptString :
"P3103626235" "Get to the Lab"
// SendOffString :
"P1871569085" "Remember, Numina will obey your commands. Use her to gain access to the laboratory and to navigate you to the holding place of the Flames. Positron's security is sure to be total, but hopefully Numina's presence will confuse or confound it long enough for you to make your way to the Flames and to use the Fists of Vulcan to seize them.<br><br>Now go, {hero.gender=male master|mistress}, and claim your power. I have done all that you have asked and look forward to being reunited with my daughter upon your return. Please, do not fail."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3010276117" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: The Titan's Gift</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P892490125" "Steal the Flames of Prometheus"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2152892951" "Remember, time is of the essence. You have a lot of enemies searching for you right now; most worrisome is the Freedom Phalanx. If they catch you before you've obtained the Flames of Prometheus then you are done for."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LocationName :
"P2388176800" "Steel Canyon: Positron's Laboratory"
// EntryString :
"P3662365104" "Numina grudgingly offers up the passcode to gain entry through Positron's security system. Her defiance is concerning but amusing when the Soul Catcher punishes her disobedience. Before long you have navigated into the lowest levels without a trace of resistance to your intrusion. This is too easy; something is going to go horribly wrong..."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2240802522" "Security Reboot Countdown"
// Script Variable ChatMessage :
"P1445388137" "Force fields are rebooting and have been temporarily deactivated."
// Script Variable FloaterMessage :
"P2338625974" "FORCE FIELDS REBOOTING"
// Script Variable ChatMessage :
"P2444021815" "WARNING: INTRUDER ALERT! INTRUDER ALERT! REACTIVATING FORCE FIELDS"
// Script Variable FloaterMessage :
"P3252149300" "FORCE FIELDS ARE REACTIVATING!"
// Script Variable ChatMessage :
"P2214003566" "ATTENTION: FOR YOUR OWN SAFETY PLEASE PROCEED TO SAFE ROOMS. SECURITY DRONES HAVE BEEN DEPLOYED TO APPREHEND INTRUDERS!"
// Script Variable FloaterMessage :
"P2365731063" "SECURITY DRONES ARRIVING!"
// Script Variable ChatMessage :
"P3605317096" "The Soul Catcher suddenly shatters, releasing Numina. Using her magic she teleports Positron and herself to safety. Cowards!"
// Script Variable FloaterMessage :
"P4226109242" "The Soul Catcher has shattered, Numina has escaped!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3478633471" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>ATTENTION: UNRECOGNIZED PERSONNEL. PLEASE IDENTIFY YOURSELVES.<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor MediumPurple>B.O.T.L.E.R., it's me, Numina...<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>VOICE AUTHORIZATION RECOGNIZED. WELCOME TAMMY ARCANUS AND GUESTS.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>DOCTOR KEYES IS CURRENTLY OUT ON PATROL, WOULD YOU LIKE ME TO INFORM HIM THAT YOU ARE HERE?<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor MediumPurple>... ugh... no... that's okay B.O.T.L.E.R., I don't need any 'help' finding my way around. Thank you."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P272595168" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>THANK YOU FOR THE SUBTLE WARNING, NUMINA. I'VE ALERTED THE SECURITY BOTS AND ERECTED FORCE FIELDS THROUGHOUT THE LABORATORY.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>NOW, WHO EXACTLY ARE OUR UNWELCOME GUESTS, AND WHAT ARE YOU DOING WITH THEM?<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor MediumPurple>It's {HeroName}, and {hero.gender=male he|she} has me trapped in an artifact called a Soul Catcher. Please, you have to... aiiieeee!<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>NUMINA!? ARE YOU ALRIGHT?<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor MediumPurple>The... Soul Catcher... it... Ahhhh!<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor MediumPurple>It's agonizing... I... I... can't... resist... any... longer... I... cannot... disobey... my {hero.gender=male master|mistress}!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1499645776" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>I'VE ALERTED DOCTOR KEYES TO THE SITUATION HERE, {HeroName}.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>HOLD ON, NUMINA, HELP IS ON THE WAY."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P555321495" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkGoldenRod>THE SECURITY SCREENS ARE BACK ONLINE, {HeroName}. I DO HOPE YOU AND YOUR VILLAINOUS CADRE WEREN'T SEPARATED FROM ONE ANOTHER."

