// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P249291347" "{Hero.gender=male Master|Mistress}, if you are contemplating what to do next I do have a suggestion.<br><br>Perhaps we could try to take over the world."
// RandomFameString :
"P2289035848" "Oh, man, it's {HeroName}. I heard he beat up Positron in his own house!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
